                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Girona FC represents the rise of modern Spanish football. A club defined by ambition, innovation and a global outlook, Girona has built a methodology rooted in attacking, possession-based football that has earned international recognition.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
