                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ESP players train with Girona's coaching staff, experiencing world-class facilities and a football philosophy that values creativity, tactical intelligence and competitive courage. The football experience is paired with medieval Girona's extraordinary culture and optional Barcelona access.",
