                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Girona is a medieval jewel in Catalonia — a city of narrow stone streets, colourful river houses, a towering cathedral and a food scene that rivals anywhere in Spain. Players experience Catalan culture, language and traditions throughout the week.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
