                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Barcelona is a short train ride away, offering an optional cultural extension — but Girona itself is the destination. The city's intimate scale, Mediterranean energy and deep football culture make it a place that stays with you.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
