                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Real Oviedo is a club built on tradition, passion and a deep connection to its city. Based at the El Requexón training center, the club has a proud identity rooted in Asturian football culture and a commitment to developing players with character and technical quality.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
