                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The coaching staff bring experience and a methodology focused on competitive readiness, tactical discipline and individual development. Players who train at El Requexón experience a professional environment shaped by decades of footballing history.",
