                      "content": "Fly to the designated local airport. ESP staff meet the player and provide supervised transportation to the program. Lodging, meals, local transportation, soccer and cultural programming are managed throughout the week."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "Y5yHo",
                  "type": "ref",
                  "ref": "JpE1j",
                  "name": "PLAYER + FAMILY (Optional)",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "descendants": {
                    "v5rf6": {
                      "content": "PLAYER + FAMILY (Optional)"
                    },
                    "DPKQD": {
                      "content": "The player participates in the full soccer program. Parents and companions can choose an optional package with hotel, selected transportation, cultural experiences and opportunities to watch the player."
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "So4ZM",
                  "type": "ref",
