                  "name": "Para 1",
                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Santander is one of northern Spain's most striking coastal cities. The bay, the Sardinero beaches and the Magdalena peninsula create a setting that balances natural beauty with urban sophistication. The city's seafood, markets and maritime culture give players a distinctive Cantabrian experience.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "matA2",
                  "name": "Para 2",
                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Cantabria's landscape moves from coast to mountains within minutes. Racing's green-and-white identity is inseparable from this place — a club and a city where football, the sea and the mountains come together in a way that is uniquely northern Spanish.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
