                  "fontFamily": "Playfair Display",
                  "fontSize": 48,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "s4j9I0",
                  "name": "Para 1",
                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Levante UD is a club defined by courage, talent and a strong international-training orientation. Based in Valencia, Levante has developed a methodology designed to prepare players for the demands of modern professional football, with a particular focus on international development.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UkopQ",
                  "name": "Para 2",
                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Training at Levante means experiencing a professional methodology shaped by the club's international outlook. The Ciudad Deportiva de Buñol and the Ciutat de València provide a high-quality training environment where players develop technical, tactical and competitive skills.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "uPdkV",
                  "name": "Para 3",
                  "fill": "$slate",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "ESP players train with Levante's coaching staff, following the club's development methodology in a professional environment. The football experience is paired with Valencia's extraordinary Mediterranean culture — beaches, historic architecture, paella and one of Spain's most vibrant cities.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Source Sans 3",
                  "fontSize": 18,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
