              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "San Sebastián is one of Europe's most beautiful coastal cities — a place where world-class cuisine, surf beaches, and a compact, walkable old town create an unforgettable setting for players experiencing European life for the first time.",
